     J. Comput. Chem., 2019 40 1463-1470
     doi.org/10.1002/jcc.25801
  4. Lang,L.; Neese,F.
     Spin-dependent properties in the framework of the dynamic correlation dressed complete active space method
     J. Chem. Phys., 2019 150 
     doi.org/10.1063/1.5085203
